id=strongbox_oplimit_unlock
name=StrongBox Op-Limit Unlocker
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=Jason
description=Lifts the per-UID StrongBox concurrent-operation limit (hardcoded 4) enforced by TEESimulator-RS / tricky_store v6.0.1-307. That limit makes StrongBox-backed apps crash on launch with KeyStoreException TOO_MANY_OPERATIONS (e.g. androidx EncryptedSharedPreferences / MasterKey users). Hash-gated: only patches the known original dex; safely skips any other version.
